+//GB: english layer #27 - the race words are shared keys. `人間` is also the player's
+//GB: race name (`race_info[].title`), a knowledge-menu group (`cmd4.c`), a detect message
+//GB: (`spells2.c`) and an item card, so the leading space belongs to THIS sentence, not to
+//GB: the word. Emit it here and keep the catalog words bare
+//GB: (docs/GENSOBAND_EN_DESIGN.md 5).
+static void gb_roff_kind(byte attr, cptr str)
+{
+	if (gb_lang_enabled()) hooked_roff(" ");
+	hook_c_roff(attr, str);
+}
